Subject: [PATCH 108/360] char: ipmi: fix ipmi_si_ls2k500.c on 6.9

Declare multiple functions as static functions to suppress warnings about
missing prototypes.

Signed-off-by: Mingcong Bai <baimingcong@uniontech.com>
---
 drivers/char/ipmi/ipmi_si_ls2k500.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/char/ipmi/ipmi_si_ls2k500.c b/drivers/char/ipmi/ipmi_si_ls2k500.c
index 7e259d85729f..1b851935d9b6 100644
--- a/drivers/char/ipmi/ipmi_si_ls2k500.c
+++ b/drivers/char/ipmi/ipmi_si_ls2k500.c
@@ -89,7 +89,7 @@ static void ipmi_ls2k500_cleanup(struct si_sm_io *io)
 {
 }
 
-int ipmi_si_sim_setup(struct si_sm_io *io)
+static int ipmi_si_sim_setup(struct si_sm_io *io)
 {
 	io->inputb = intf_sim_inb;
 	io->outputb = intf_sim_outb;
